# Octane Traders — broker overrides (optional)
# Copy this file to config_local.py (same folder as octane-copier.exe) and edit.
# It OVERRIDES the built-in config.py WITHOUT rebuilding the exe.
#
# Edit these for YOUR broker, then restart the copier.

# USD value of one unit (pip / $ / point) per 1.0 lot.
# VERIFY against MT5: right-click a symbol -> Specification -> "Tick value".
